uest tới Lambda function khi client gọi API. Giữ route/integration/response context, function source-local.","source_sha256":"55749249a7aac53f50dbedc38dc232bb9b91e75b0bb4be37ca77ad984b32ef8c","source_unit_id":"graph-full-v2_0cd897b4545e3ceeb5766079b8cbaf0d48952e031c58b08dc0a675a968cd37ca","status":"AI_SOURCE_SUPPORTED_SOURCE_SCOPED"},{"candidate_sha256":"6d730ee77b8d560e62ef51e408be656bf83d5115d20caae65c8cc77ff4f43e0b","origin":"INVENTORY","prior_v1_index":13,"reason_vi":"Chunk bắt đầu nt delivery fails, điều kiện đã bị cắt ở đầu. Cần contiguous document context trước khi giữ assertion.","source_sha256":"69cab0ee1e4a0ab3096fa1c2e73fc48002682ab1db8597714f313a6fb932643e","source_unit_id":"graph-full-v2_c7d34e1aa6218b1c71ea8e145b2a00d02bdbb5b307bd00a2c2c44a182ee28e23","status":"AI_QUARANTINE_TRUNCATED_SOURCE_CONDITION"},{"candidate_sha256":"1d7d5212b7a46f8f2a31e6193153918d1c6f302c0ca335a11b9253cb2ec65a7f","origin":"INVENTORY","prior_v1_index":14,"reason_vi":"SNS decrypts messages trong server-side encryption khi access, có authentication/access-permission context. Không khẳng định anonymous request có thể đọc.","source_sha256":"71903b9f5f866d8ef51533bd14af49b9ad599546ad14218bb50ee46571eb62c7","source_unit_id":"graph-full-v2_3c5d4117f35e8f095de4cb6c645d85d617e898972e717578babe90243771737d","status":"AI_SOURCE_SUPPORTED_SOURCE_SCOPED"},{"candidate_sha256":"b373670facea3001744f42e458f69da48d5eff78e2092a8158888f0c18d807c3","origin":"INVENTORY","prior_v1_index":15,"reason_vi":"EventBridge encrypts event at rest theo KMS config bus thứ nhất khi target là bus ở Region khác. Full chunk phân biệt same-Region, cross-Region và delivery encryption; không gộp hai nhánh.","source_sha256":"8af175c6a92aa8afec407ebaa2aef801f7f94f039437891fe0d4744c4c25fac0","source_unit_id":"graph-full-v2_53feb559b89d6cb8a49af151eb029ecbf40fc74b083d9436463ea3d653de2813","status":"AI_SOURCE_SUPPORTED_SOURCE_SCOPED"},{"candidate_sha256":"c2e4f0553202eba0c3d3bfeddba3e57b4cd14651ae83092d7b62ec405cd4a73b","o